00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:01.720
M: I just realized what I was doing.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:04.960
There's a pool of pink dye
inside here now.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.960
I can't layer colors
like I thought it was gonna do.

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:12.600
Oh!

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.040
Oh, what are you doing?

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:17.160
That's the worst thing I've ever seen!

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.140
That's supposed to be FOAM!

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:21.380
E: How much time do we have?

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:24.780
M: I don't like living under this kind of freedom.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.140
I need a time constraint.

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:28.920
I need to feel the guillotine
above my neck.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:30.740
Why are these wet?

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:33.080
E: Oh, it's because I spilled water.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.420
*MARK AND ETHAN LAUGHS*

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:36.640
M: *WHIMPERS* Oh..

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:41.700
*bye bye box*

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:43.040
M: Alright...

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:45.120
E: I'm gonna do an experiment with one.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.440
I'm gonna put it in boiling water.

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:47.500
What will happen?

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:48.340
T: Whoa whoa whoa!

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:51.280
E: No.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.880
Oh, no!

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:55.740
It cracked.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:58.160
E: Don't worry about it.

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:00.040
Oww, it's boiling water. Oww.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.500
C: Did that change colors?

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:04.980
E: Yeah. It did. I don't know how.

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:07.460
I'll just rest you right there, little guy.

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:08.340
M: I'm done.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.060
E: Done?

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.040
M: I've finished.

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:13.820
T: I have one minute?

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:21.740
*MARK CHORTLES*

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:30.480
*Scared Mark ponders in confusion and amusement*

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.820
M: What was your thought process?

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:35.120
E: Obviously there wasn't one!

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:44.840
M: Last egg thing, WE were fine,
YOU spread your disease...

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:47.840
..your egg-based disease to me.

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:52.120
It hasn't quite reached Tyler yet,
but next time we do an egg thing...

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:54.860
T: No he got me,
it splattered on my face.

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:56.060
*footage from Markiplier Makes: An Egg Drop*

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.900
M: Oh... Just... *UNINTELLIGIBLE*

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:04.000
AAARRRGGGHHH!

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.200
What's the time at?

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.880
E: This happens every time.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.100
M: Yeah, Ethan, you go first

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:12.900
E: I go first?

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:14.460
M: Yeah, go first.
E: All three eggs? Are we presenting?

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:15.780
M: Yeah, sure.

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:16.500
E: Alright.

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:22.060
Here they are.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:26.660
We've got Egg, he's got "egg"
written all over him.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:31.420
We've got number two.
Here he is, I call him.... Hat!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.800
E: Yeah, that's what he's doing.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:40.200
And then we have...
the last one, that turned pink.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:43.080
He's got a little spewage going on,

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.980
but that doesn't mean that
he doesn't like to party, you know?

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:47.400
M: *SIGHS* Okay...

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:49.660
Larry, Barry, and Scary. That's it.

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:51.900
*APPLAUSE*

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:55.020
T: Mine are themed.
You've got Mama Bunny egg...

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:58.440
..with her two beautiful themed boys.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:13:59.720
M: Yeah, okay, alright.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:03.120
But we are not judging them
on appearance... at all.

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:05.000
Appearance has nothing to do with this.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.660
We're judging these on strength.

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:10.360
- E: What?
- M: Strength of will. Strength of ability.

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:13.940
Doesn't matter how pretty they are,
how they look. This is WAR!

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:16.860
And my champions,
Larry, Barry, and Scary,

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:19.320
are gonna crush the snot out
of your eggs!

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.440
Who's going first?

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:22.280
E: I don't know what we're doing.

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:23.180
M: Who's going first?

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:23.920
E: I'll go first.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.760
M: Alright, who do you volunteer?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.300
E: I volunteer Egg.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.280
*TYLER LAUGHS*

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:31.100
M: I volunteer Barry.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:35.280
We're at war. We fight.
Whichever one breaks first... dies.

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:35.780
E: Ready?

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:36.480
M: Yeah

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.600
E: Set... Go.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:45.580
M: No we actually gotta... *LAUGHS*

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:46.900
E: Ready? Go!

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:50.220
M: C'mon.

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:52.060
YEAH! YEAH!

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:53.440
T: You lost.
M: Hang on...

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:57.180
M: Die, die, gimme that!

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:58.840
E: No, no ,no, you don't touch him!

00:14:58.840 --> 00:14:59.860
M: Put him down!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:04.640
*MARK AND TYLER LAUGH*

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:05.780
YEAH BARRY!

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.520
E: His body will remain...

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:09.540
M: Alright. On the battlefield.

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:12.160
Alright, who's gonna go
up against Barry?

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:12.900
E: Blue boy.

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:15.560
M: Blue Boy's gonna go?
Alright. Here we go.

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:18.900
M: Uh-oh.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:19.880
*TYLER LAUGHS*

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:24.740
Barry, no! Barry! BARRY! NO! NO!

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:26.180
E: Leave his corpse there.

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.340
T: The Scheid's the winner.

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:32.360
E: Alright.
Graduated life, bitch.

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:35.480
M: Oh no, his armor!

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.640
E: AAAAHAHAHA!
YES, GRADUATION!

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:44.360
M: Alright, Larry. Larry it's time
to avenge your brother, Barry.

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.400
M: HaHAAhaha!

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:47.020
E: No...

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:50.360
*MARK LAUGHS*

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:51.760
T: You're getting Scheid towards you.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:52.780
M: Alright.

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:57.680
M: AAAAAHHHHH!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:58.300
T: Scheid!

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:00.300
E: What are we doing?

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.640
T: BRING IT ON!

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:03.440
E: Well, mine's already dying...

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:04.300
T: Yeah, bring it on.

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:06.220
E: I'm going to take off his cap.

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:08.020
T: Well he'd lost forfeit.

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:09.000
M: That's not gonna help him

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.400
E: No, you don't know anything.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.440
M: Oh. He's risking all.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:15.940
E: C'mon!

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:16.700
T: Alright.

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.060
E: Go! 'Till he breaks!

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:24.440
T: He already broke!

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:25.380
E: No!

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:27.640
*SLURPY NOISES*

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:30.620
*MARK LAUGHS*

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:35.540
P: Oh the sound!

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:36.680
M: I think he's broken.

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:37.780
T: I think he's broken.

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:40.400
M: I think he broke.
Alright, it's up to you, Scary.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:42.300
Your brothers need to be avenged.

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.500
No, it's the win- the winner takes all!

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:49.880
NO! SCARY!

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:52.180
KILL-- God...

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:54.780
T: Scheid, boy!

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.140
M: Now they have to fight. *CHUCKLES*

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:58.060
E: Brothers!

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.840
- M: Mother!
- T: No, mother!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.140
E: Oedipus, no

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:05.280
T: SHE KILLED THE BROTHER!

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:06.660
Mother Scheid!

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:09.860
I'm just squishing her face...

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:16.840
*TYLER LAUGHS*

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:18.720
M: Finish it, you gotta finish it.

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:23.700
T: It's not going in any further.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.400
T: Oh no... look...

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.560
C: The plastic protected it.

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:29.740
(PAM MAKES VOMIT NOISE)

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:32.000
M: Oh God...

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:34.360
And we have a winner!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:35.940
M: The... the blood...

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:36.760
T: Golden egg!

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:39.300
M: The bloodthirsty Golden egg,

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:43.340
here to rein supreme over all the dead.

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:46.800
Thank you everybody for joining us
for this Easter special.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:48.080
I hope you enjoyed it.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.160
E: This year was special.

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:50.900
M: It sure was special.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:55.159
Thank you all for a wonderful time
with "Markiplier Makes".

00:17:55.159 --> 00:17:56.260
And remember...

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.060
Even if it's not the prettiest egg--

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:02.300
well in this case
the prettiest egg won-- but!

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:06.280
Even if it's not the prettiest egg,
It can still fight!

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:08.160
So thank you everybody so much for watching.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:10.540
Check out Ethan's channel at CrankGameplays,

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:13.780
Tyler's got a Twitch over at Apocalypto_12,

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.240
and I'm Markiplier.

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:18.040
And as always, we'll see you in the next one.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:18.940
Buh-bye!

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:20.080
T: Bye!

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:22.080
*end tape*

